/E ("Now, this is where WE step in. A design is just a picture; it doesn't do anything if you tap it. As Flutter Developers, our job is to bring these designs to life. We take the UI/UX screens and write the Dart code to build the actual application. The beauty of Flutter is that we write this code only once, and we generate apps for both Android and iOS. We build the screens, add the animations, and handle the user interactions.")
